[center][img]{IMG}/header_changelog_1200x140.png[/img][/center]

[b]0.1.0: first public release (release candidate)[/b]
[list]
[*]Master container, Deposit, Distribute on master close, Sort all, and Retrieve (everything or by category)
[*]37 keyword-driven default categories, with add-on category packs supported
[*]Learned destinations from items you place by hand
[*]22 templates (vanilla, Hearthfire, Dragonborn, Creation Club), with auto-enable as an option and Re-apply that keeps your changes
[*]Keep rules: global defaults, per-home always/never rules and quotas
[*]SKSE Menu Framework panel: actions, containers, learned items, keep rules, template export, settings, template browser and diagnostics
[*]Native message-box interface, used as the fallback and on VR
[*]Safety checks for ownership, respawning, disabled and scripted containers. Layout backups. Broken layout files are never overwritten.
[*]One DLL for SE 1.5.97, AE 1.6.x and VR (experimental)
[/list]
[size=2][color=#8c8c8c]Planned, not in this version: pulling crafting materials from storage, and central storage shared across homes.[/color][/size]

